#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.trojita.appdata.xml:6
msgid "Trojitá"
msgstr "Trojitá"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.trojita.appdata.xml:7
msgid "IMAP E-mail Client"
msgstr "Veceru de corréu IMAP"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.trojita.appdata.xml:9
msgid ""
"Trojitá is an email program (\"client\") specialized in giving fast and "
"efficient access to mailboxes over the IMAP protocol. An IMAP mail server "
"stores messages and allows clients to fetch messages to the local computer "
"when asked for."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.trojita.appdata.xml:13
msgid ""
"It prioritizes efficiency, speed and open standards above other goals. "
"Trojitá also aims to be multi-platform, and functions well on everything "
"from big desktop computers to small cellphones. Trojitá is a stand-alone "
"program, not part of a \"personal information manager\" suite."
msgstr ""
"Prioriza la eficiencia, velocidá y estándares abiertos sobro otres metes. "
"Trojitá tamién tien l'oxetivu de ser multi-plataforma y furrular en toa "
"triba de preseos. Trojitá ye un programa independiente, non una parte "
"de la suit del «xestor d'información personal»."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.trojita.appdata.xml:18
msgid "What could make Trojitá interesting for you:"
msgstr "Qué te podría interesar de Trojitá:"

